---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RIQUEZAR | Comunidade de empreendedores de bazares"
  description="Uma comunidade para empreendedores de bazares trocarem experiências, fortalecerem seus negócios e crescerem juntos."
>
  <main class="riquezar-page">
    <header class="rq-header">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-header-row">
        <a href="/" class="rq-back">← Voltar ao blog</a>
        <a class="rq-wordmark" href="/" aria-label="RIQUEZAR, página inicial">RIQUEZAR<span>COMUNIDADE DE EMPREENDEDORES DE BAZARES</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="rq-hero">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-hero-grid">
        <div class="rq-hero-copy">
          <p class="rq-eyebrow"><span></span> Gente que empreende. Ideias que circulam.</p>
          <h1>Seu bazar cresce quando <em>a comunidade cresce junto.</em></h1>
          <p class="rq-lede">RIQUEZAR é uma comunidade pensada para quem empreende com bazares: um espaço para trocar experiências, compartilhar aprendizados e encontrar novas maneiras de fortalecer o próprio negócio.</p>
          <a class="rq-button" href="#participar">Quero conhecer a comunidade <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="rq-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="rq-sun"></div>
          <div class="rq-market-roof"></div>
          <div class="rq-market-stall"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="rq-crate rq-crate-one"></div><div class="rq-crate rq-crate-two"></div>
          <span class="rq-art-label">IDEIAS · TROCAS · CRESCIMENTO</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-manifesto">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-manifesto-grid">
        <p class="rq-eyebrow">O que é o RIQUEZAR</p>
        <div><h2>Uma rede para quem faz o bazar acontecer.</h2><p>Cada empreendedor tem uma história, uma experiência e algo que pode ensinar. O RIQUEZAR aproxima essas vivências para que ideias, contatos e caminhos de negócio possam circular entre pessoas que entendem os desafios de empreender em bazares.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-pillars" aria-label="O que a comunidade valoriza">
      <div class="rq-wrap">
        <div class="rq-section-heading"><p class="rq-eyebrow">Uma comunidade feita de troca</p><h2>Conexões que fortalecem o seu negócio.</h2></div>
        <div class="rq-card-grid">
          <article class="rq-card rq-card-coral"><span class="rq-card-number">01</span><h3>Trocar experiências</h3><p>Compartilhe desafios, aprendizados e boas ideias com outros empreendedores de bazares.</p></article>
          <article class="rq-card rq-card-yellow"><span class="rq-card-number">02</span><h3>Aprender na prática</h3><p>Descubra perspectivas e soluções que ajudam a organizar e movimentar o seu negócio.</p></article>
          <article class="rq-card rq-card-green"><span class="rq-card-number">03</span><h3>Crescer em rede</h3><p>Construa conexões, amplie seu repertório e faça parte de uma comunidade que cresce junto.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-store" id="bazar-da-prosperidade">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-store-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="rq-eyebrow">Loja parceira</p>
          <h2>Bazar da Prosperidade</h2>
          <p>Conheça a loja, veja as novidades no Instagram e fale diretamente pelo WhatsApp para comprar ou doar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rq-store-actions">
          <a class="rq-button" href="https://bazardaprosperidade.livrepracrescer.com.br/">Visitar a loja <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="rq-social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/bazardaprosperidade385/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram @bazardaprosperidade385 ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-actions" aria-label="Compre ou doe">
      <div class="rq-wrap">
        <div class="rq-section-heading"><p class="rq-eyebrow">Bazar da Prosperidade</p><h2>Compre, doe e faça a prosperidade circular.</h2></div>
        <div class="rq-action-grid">
          <article class="rq-action-card rq-buy">
            <p class="rq-eyebrow">COMPRE</p>
            <h3>Encontre algo especial no bazar.</h3>
            <p>Fale com a equipe para consultar os itens disponíveis e combinar sua compra.</p>
            <a class="rq-button" href="https://wa.me/5511981017219?text=Ol%C3%A1%21%20Tenho%20interesse%20em%20comprar%20no%20Bazar%20da%20Prosperidade." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Comprar pelo WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="rq-action-card rq-donate">
            <p class="rq-eyebrow">DOE</p>
            <h3>Doe e ajude o bazar a continuar.</h3>
            <p>Entre em contato para conversar sobre sua doação e combinar os próximos passos.</p>
            <a class="rq-button" href="https://wa.me/5511981017219?text=Ol%C3%A1%21%20Quero%20saber%20como%20doar%20para%20o%20Bazar%20da%20Prosperidade." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Doar pelo WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-regions" id="regioes-atendidas">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-regions-grid">
        <div><p class="rq-eyebrow">Onde atendemos</p><h2>Região Central de São Paulo</h2><p>Atendimento nos distritos da Subprefeitura Sé:</p></div>
        <ul class="rq-neighborhoods">
          <li>Bela Vista</li><li>Bom Retiro</li><li>Cambuci</li><li>Consolação</li>
          <li>Liberdade</li><li>República</li><li>Santa Cecília</li><li>Sé</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rq-invite" id="participar">
      <div class="rq-wrap rq-invite-inner">
        <div><p class="rq-eyebrow">Seu próximo passo</p><h2>Empreende com bazar? Tem lugar para você aqui.</h2><p>Fale com a gente para conhecer a proposta do RIQUEZAR e manifestar seu interesse em participar.</p></div>
        <a class="rq-button rq-button-light" href="https://wa.me/5511951705334?text=Ol%C3%A1%21%20Quero%20conhecer%20o%20RIQUEZAR%20e%20tenho%20interesse%20em%20participar%20da%20comunidade%20de%20empreendedores%20de%20bazares." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tenho interesse em participar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="rq-footer"><div class="rq-wrap rq-footer-inner"><a class="rq-wordmark" href="/">RIQUEZAR<span>COMUNIDADE DE EMPREENDEDORES DE BAZARES</span></a><a href="/">Voltar ao início</a></div></footer>
  </main>

  <style>
    .riquezar-page{--rq-ink:#202820;--rq-paper:#f6f0e4;--rq-cream:#fffaf0;--rq-coral:#de6048;--rq-yellow:#f1b832;--rq-green:#235745;background:var(--rq-paper);color:var(--rq-ink);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
    .rq-wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 48px));margin-inline:auto}
    .rq-header{background:var(--rq-cream);border-bottom:1px solid #e4dac8}
    .rq-header-row{min-height:82px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
    .rq-back{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
    .rq-wordmark{display:inline-grid;gap:2px;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;line-height:1;color:var(--rq-green)}
    .rq-wordmark span{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}
    .rq-hero{padding:62px 0 74px;background:var(--rq-cream);overflow:hidden}
    .rq-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center;gap:60px}
    .rq-eyebrow{margin:0 0 17px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .rq-hero .rq-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#6b6d55}
    .rq-hero .rq-eyebrow span{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--rq-coral)}
    .rq-hero h1{max-width:650px;margin:0;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,76px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:1.02}
    .rq-hero h1 em{color:var(--rq-coral);font-style:normal}
    .rq-lede{max-width:580px;margin:24px 0 28px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#55594f}
    .rq-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 21px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--rq-green);color:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;transition:transform .2s,background .2s}
    .rq-button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#173f31}
    .rq-button span{font-size:18px}
    .rq-hero-art{position:relative;min-height:380px;border-radius:48% 48% 8px 8px;background:#e8c47c;overflow:hidden}
    .rq-sun{position:absolute;top:42px;right:54px;width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;background:#de6048}
    .rq-market-roof{position:absolute;left:13%;right:13%;top:43%;height:18%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#235745 0 20%,#fffaf0 20% 40%);clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,88% 100%,12% 100%)}
    .rq-market-stall{position:absolute;left:20%;right:20%;top:59%;height:28%;background:#fffaf0;border:8px solid #235745;border-top:0;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:0 8px}
    .rq-market-stall i{width:12%;height:100%;background:#de6048;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,80% 100%,20% 100%)}
    .rq-crate{position:absolute;bottom:7%;width:18%;height:15%;background:#b87245;border:6px solid #8b4e35}
    .rq-crate-one{left:12%}.rq-crate-two{right:12%;height:19%}
    .rq-art-label{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:3%;text-align:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em;color:#314739}
    .rq-manifesto{padding:88px 0;background:var(--rq-green);color:#fffaf0}
    .rq-manifesto-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1.4fr;gap:45px}
    .rq-manifesto .rq-eyebrow{color:#f1b832}
    .rq-manifesto h2,.rq-section-heading h2,.rq-invite h2{margin:0;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.1}
    .rq-manifesto p:not(.rq-eyebrow),.rq-invite p:not(.rq-eyebrow){max-width:720px;margin:20px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#e5e6db}
    .rq-pillars{padding:88px 0}
    .rq-section-heading{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:38px}
    .rq-section-heading .rq-eyebrow{color:#9b6242}
    .rq-card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .rq-card{min-height:250px;padding:28px;border-radius:5px}
    .rq-card-coral{background:#f1d5ca}.rq-card-yellow{background:#f2e3b9}.rq-card-green{background:#d4e1d6}
    .rq-card-number{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}
    .rq-card h3{margin:50px 0 10px;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
    .rq-card p{margin:0;color:#55594f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
    .rq-store{padding:65px 0;background:#f2e3b9}
    .rq-store-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:32px}
    .rq-store .rq-eyebrow,.rq-action-card .rq-eyebrow,.rq-regions .rq-eyebrow{color:#9b6242}
    .rq-store h2,.rq-regions h2{margin:0;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.1}
    .rq-store p:not(.rq-eyebrow),.rq-regions p:not(.rq-eyebrow){max-width:660px;margin:14px 0 0;color:#55594f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}
    .rq-store-actions{display:grid;justify-items:start;gap:14px}
    .rq-social-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--rq-green)}
    .rq-actions{padding:88px 0}
    .rq-action-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
    .rq-action-card{min-height:300px;padding:32px;border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
    .rq-buy{background:#f1d5ca}.rq-donate{background:#d4e1d6}
    .rq-action-card h3{max-width:440px;margin:16px 0 8px;font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.15}
    .rq-action-card>p:not(.rq-eyebrow){max-width:470px;margin:0 0 24px;color:#55594f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
    .rq-action-card .rq-button{margin-top:auto}
    .rq-regions{padding:76px 0;background:#235745;color:#fffaf0}
    .rq-regions .rq-eyebrow{color:#f1b832}
    .rq-regions p:not(.rq-eyebrow){color:#e5e6db}
    .rq-regions-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:50px}
    .rq-neighborhoods{margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;list-style:none}
    .rq-neighborhoods li{padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #668274;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
    .rq-invite{padding:75px 0;background:var(--rq-coral);color:white}
    .rq-invite-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px}
    .rq-invite .rq-eyebrow{color:#ffe0a7}
    .rq-invite p:not(.rq-eyebrow){color:#fff0e8}
    .rq-button-light{flex:none;background:#fffaf0;color:#202820}
    .rq-button-light:hover{background:#f6f0e4}
    .rq-footer{padding:30px 0;background:#202820;color:#fffaf0}
    .rq-footer-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
    .rq-footer .rq-wordmark{color:#f1b832}
    .rq-footer-inner>a:last-child{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
    @media(max-width:760px){.rq-hero{padding:45px 0 50px}.rq-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.rq-hero-art{min-height:300px}.rq-manifesto-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.rq-card-grid,.rq-action-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rq-card{min-height:190px}.rq-card h3{margin-top:28px}.rq-store-grid,.rq-regions-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.rq-store-actions{justify-items:start}.rq-neighborhoods{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.rq-invite-inner{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.rq-footer-inner{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.riquezar-page *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
